Z||000000||CoolBlue87GT||12-17-2001||11:16 PM||||It's an 85 SE Coupe<P>It's been painted black, (was red, then yellow)<P>Looks good, 'bout an 8 on a scale of 1 - 10<P>Has V6, Auto, has luggage rack w/ small black wing<P>Have seen from outside, didn't get a look inside yet.<P>Spoke to the guy on phone, say's it was the wife's car, said it's now the 3rd car, they needed bigger.<P>Told me it runs fine, not ragged out.<P>Selling price 1850 OBO<P>I'll get some pic's & check out more tomorrow.  What do you all think about the price ?<P>I've never driven an automatic Fiero before. Are they different ?<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/CoolBluesig.gif"> ||||reg||6
